        },
        "quote": "Water system fees shall be determined by the Utilities Director or his or her designee, and approved by the City Manager, and reviewed and adjusted if necessary at least every five years. Such water system fees shall be set forth on a schedule maintained by the Utilities Director. Such fees shall be based on the system’s value, capacity and demand factors.",
